# Field-identical to rosbag2_interfaces/srv/Stop as of rosbag2 0.34 (Rolling), deliberately.
#
# Jazzy and Kilted ship Stop with an empty response, so a client there cannot tell "stopped" from
# "was not recording". Where the installed rosbag2_interfaces has this shape the recorder offers
# ~/stop under the stock type; elsewhere under this copy. See Record.srv.

---
# Return code. Returns 1 when recording or playback is already stopped or in case of error, otherwise 0.
int32 return_code

# Error string. Empty if no error occurred.
string error_string
